" xml:lang="zh-CN">有多少思绪不曾言说</span></p><p begin="35.734" end="38.086" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.734" end="36.082">Held</span> <span begin="36.082" end="36.394">in</span> <span begin="36.394" end="36.712">this</span> <span begin="36.712" end="38.086">hand?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尽数敛于手掌</span></p><p begin="38.892" end="43.332" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.892" end="39.072">The</span> <span begin="39.072" end="39.345">weight</span> <span begin="39.345" end="40.014">of</span> <span begin="40.014" end="40.117">the</span> <span begin="40.117" end="40.392">old</span> <span begin="40.392" end="41.438">skies</span> <span begin="41.738" end="41.912">on</span> <span begin="41.912" end="42.077">my</span> <span begin="42.077" end="43.067">shoulder</span><span begin="43.067" end="43.332">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">旧日的重量压在肩头</span></p><p begin="43.772" end="45.698" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.772" end="44.066">Sun</span> <span begin="44.066" end="44.385">light</span> <span begin="44.385" end="44.704">in</span> <span begin="44.704" end="45.698">disguise</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">伪装成阳光模样</span></p><p begin="45.733" end="47.018" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.733" end="46.048">Who</span> <span begin="46.048" end="46.618">would</span> <span begin="46.618" end="46.743">have</span> <span begin="46.743" end="47.018">known</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">又有谁能预料</span></p><p begin="47.373" end="53.343" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.373" end="47.673">There&apos;s</span> <span begin="47.673" end="48.033">an</span> <span begin="48.033" end="49.063">end</span> <span begin="49.063" end="49.423">to</span> <span begin="49.423" end="53.343">eternity?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">永恒也有其终章</span></p><p begin="53.689" end="56.898" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.689" end="54.032">The</span> <span begin="54.032" end="55.003">lone</span> <span begin="55.003" end="55.383">tale</span> <span begin="55.383" end="55.831">is</span> <span begin="55.831" end="55.989">no</span> <span begin="55.989" end="56.898">more</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">独行往事至此落幕</span></p><p begin="57.123" end="1:00.730" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.123" end="57.388">As</span> <span begin="57.388" end="57.718">a</span> <span begin="57.718" end="58.353">breeze</span> <span begin="58.353" end="58.652">brush</span><span begin="58.652" end="59.031">es</span> <span begin="59.031" end="1:00.730">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当微风一阵阵拂过</span></p><p begin="1:01.073" end="1:04.709" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.073" end="1:01.343">As</span> <span begin="1:01.343" end="1:01.693">the</span> <span begin="1:01.693" end="1:02.032">days</span> <span begin="1:02.032" end="1:02.598">drift</span> <span begin="1:02.598" end="1:03.043">on</span> <span begin="1:03.043" end="1:04.709">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当日子一天天流过</span></p><p begin="1:05.077" end="1:09.109" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.077" end="1:05.385">Found</span> <span begin="1:05.385" end="1:05.699">a</span> <span begin="1:05.699" end="1:06.586">steady</span> <span begin="1:06.586" end="1:07.708">shore</span> <span begin="1:07.708" end="1:08.055">of</span> <span begin="1:08.055" end="1:09.109">trust</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我在广袤的大地上</span></p><p begin="1:09.109" end="1:11.849" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.109" end="1:09.409">In</span> <span begin="1:09.409" end="1:09.684">this</span> <span begin="1:09.684" end="1:10.389">vast</span> <span begin="1:10.389" end="1:11.849">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">找到了值得信赖的坚实湾港</span></p><p begin="1:13.074" end="1:16.682" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.074" end="1:13.389">As</span> <span begin="1:13.389" end="1:13.682">we</span> <span begin="1:13.682" end="1:14.034">walk</span> <span begin="1:14.034" end="1:14.600">side</span> <span begin="1:14.600" end="1:15.004">by</span> <span begin="1:15.004" end="1:16.682">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当我们并肩同行</span></p><p begin="1:17.024" end="1:20.709" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.024" end="1:17.334">The</span> <span begin="1:17.334" end="1:17.694">script</span> <span begin="1:17.694" end="1:18.009">is</span> <span begin="1:18.009" end="1:18.584">fad</span><span begin="1:18.584" end="1:19.034">ing</span> <span begin="1:19.034" end="1:20.709">away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">命运瓦解冰消</span></p><p begin="1:21.048" end="1:24.858" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.048" end="1:21.373">And</span> <span begin="1:21.373" end="1:21.683">the</span> <span begin="1:21.683" end="1:22.633">frozen</span> <span begin="1:22.633" end="1:23.693">dawn</span> <span begin="1:23.693" end="1:23.858">stream</span><span begin="1:23.858" end="1:24.063">s</span> <span begin="1:24.063" end="1:24.858">forth</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">曾冻结的曙光融作溪流潺潺向前</span></p><p begin="1:25.069" end="1:29.015" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.069" end="1:26.445">Into</span> <span begin="1:26.445" end="1:26.725">the</span> <span begin="1:26.725" end="1:29.015">new</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">流入新的一方</span></p><p begin="1:48.002" end="1:50.153" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.002" end="1:48.345">Now</span> <span begin="1:48.345" end="1:48.860">I</span> <span begin="1:48.860" end="1:49.012">can</span> <span begin="1:49.012" end="1:50.153">see</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如我所见</span></p><p begin="1:51.064" end="1:54.848" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.064" end="1:51.361">You</span> <span begin="1:51.361" e