e</span> <span begin="2:29.101" end="2:29.541">brush</span><span begin="2:29.541" end="2:30.011">es</span> <span begin="2:30.011" end="2:31.696">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当微风一阵阵拂过</span></p><p begin="2:32.072" end="2:35.712" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.072" end="2:32.430">As</span> <span begin="2:32.430" end="2:32.755">the</span> <span begin="2:32.755" end="2:33.057">days</span> <span begin="2:33.057" end="2:33.559">drift</span> <span begin="2:33.559" end="2:34.016">on</span> <span begin="2:34.016" end="2:35.712">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当日子一天天流过</span></p><p begin="2:36.044" end="2:40.079" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:36.044" end="2:36.415">Found</span> <span begin="2:36.415" end="2:36.719">a</span> <span begin="2:36.719" end="2:37.539">steady</span> <span begin="2:37.539" end="2:38.394">shore</span> <span begin="2:38.732" end="2:39.030">of</span> <span begin="2:39.030" end="2:40.079">trust</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我在广袤的大地上</span></p><p begin="2:40.079" end="2:42.652" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.079" end="2:40.403">In</span> <span begin="2:40.403" end="2:40.697">this</span> <span begin="2:40.697" end="2:41.403">vast</span> <span begin="2:41.403" end="2:42.652">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">找到了值得信赖的坚实湾港</span></p><p begin="2:44.033" end="2:47.483" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.033" end="2:44.395">As</span> <span begin="2:44.395" end="2:44.715">we</span> <span begin="2:44.715" end="2:45.043">walk</span> <span begin="2:45.043" end="2:45.557">side</span> <span begin="2:45.557" end="2:45.994">by</span> <span begin="2:45.994" end="2:47.483">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当我们并肩前行</span></p><p begin="2:48.057" end="2:51.677" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:48.057" end="2:48.362">The</span> <span begin="2:48.362" end="2:48.697">scr