translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即便世事潮汐起落无常</span></p><p begin="3:08.087" end="3:10.642" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.087" end="3:08.477">We&apos;ll</span> <span begin="3:08.477" end="3:08.727">know</span> <span begin="3:08.727" end="3:09.402">our</span> <span begin="3:09.402" end="3:10.642">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们知道要去往何方</span></p><p begin="3:12.017" end="3:15.622" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:12.017" end="3:12.342">Don&apos;t</span> <span begin="3:12.342" end="3:12.677">need</span> <span begin="3:12.677" end="3:13.012">to</span> <span begin="3:13.012" end="3:13.737">be</span> <span begin="3:13.737" end="3:15.622">afraid</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无需惧怕</span></p><p begin="3:16.037" end="3:19.687" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:16.037" end="3:16.312">Set</span> <span begin="3:16.312" end="3:16.687">sail</span> <span begin="3:16.687" end="3:17.017">and</span> <span begin="3:17.017" end="3:17.562">row</span> <span begin="3:17.562" end="3:19.687">away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">扬帆起航</span></p><p begin="3:20.042" end="3:22.347" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:20.042" end="3:20.692">Never</span> <span begin="3:20.692" end="3:21.017">felt</span> <span begin="3:21.017" end="3:21.522">so</span> <span begin="3:21.522" end="3:22.347">safe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">从未如此安心</span></p><p begin="3:22.716" end="3:27.701" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:22.716" end="3:23.039">With</span> <span begin="3:23.039" end="3:23.584">you,</span> <span begin="3:23.584" end="3:24.054">I</span> <span begin="3:24.054" end="3:24.349">can</span> <span begin="3:24.349" end="3:24.684">step</span> <span begin="3:24.684" end="3:25.496">into</span> <span begin="3:25.496" end="3:25.621">the</span> <span begin="3:25.621" end="3:27.701">new</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有你们相伴，我能奔赴新的篇章